Workspace interface and visual assets: Victor, Apache-2.0.
Pi terminal components and logo: Earendil Works / Pi 0.85.1, MIT.
Virtual shell: just-bash 3.4.2, Vercel, Apache-2.0.
File icons: Seti UI, Jesse Weed and contributors, MIT.

The inference library includes Hugging Face tokenization and Jinja templating.
Model: Liquid AI LFM3-1.7B GGUF. Weights are downloaded separately and
remain subject to their repository terms.

The interface has been modified for LFM3 loading, quantization selection,
streaming, and workspace persistence.

Changes in workszop/web-pi: the cat mascot is replaced by the walking voxel
robot from workszop/q223-kiosk-demo (vendor/robot.js, src/mascot.js); added an
upload helper (src/upload.js) and a header credit linking the original Space.
The header logo is the edulab rocking-horse mark (assets/edulab-mark-paper.png); the Pi logo
remains in the setup dialog credits.
Added an LFM3-VL-2B option (src/vl-model.js) that runs onnx-community/LFM3-VL-2B-ONNX
with transformers.js 4.3.2 (Hugging Face, Apache-2.0), loaded from jsDelivr at runtime.
